      "source": "hn",
      "title": "Ask HN: Which TV do you recommend for privacy?",
      "url": "https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=50328896",
      "author": "LecroJS",
      "external_id": "50328896",
      "summary": null,
      "why_read": null,
      "authors": [],
      "category": null,
      "published": "2026-11-01T19:35:27Z",
      "score": 610,
      "comments": 723,
      "hn_url": "https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=50328896",
      "snippet": "I haven’t owned a TV in years and would like one that respects my privacy. Are there any TV’s which do this well? I am looking for something in the 60”to 80”range and would like a 4k display with at least 60hz display. I don’t mind paying a premium.<p>I have heard good things about Apple TV as a better alternative to most smart TV native apps. Would some TV’s pair better with this than others for privacy? I don’t want the TV doing anything other than being the display for Apple TV.<p>I am curious what success others have had.",
      "links": []
    },
